#concept-box("Carry this into Chapter 6")[
  Chapter 5 sorts the sounds; Chapter 6 puts them into words. Stress is which of a word's syllables is loudest, intonation is which way the tune of a sentence goes, and rhyme is which sounds match from the stressed vowel onwards — three questions that all begin with the syllable count you have just learned to make.
]

